    "hash": "6cb9fb1561f8ae7e",
    "text": "To the steering board · Digital Services Hochmatt Informatik · 2023 One design system for our citizen services THE PROBLEM Seven of nine products fail WCAG 2.1 AA. Four UI libraries, eleven primary blues, six date pickers. Citizens think they deal with different authorities. THE BUSINESS CASE 480 hours spent rebuilding one date picker, counted by the nine teams themselves THE PILOT WE ASK FOR Six months, two products chosen by pain, not prestige A core team of three; contributors from the product teams Continue only if both pilot products ship a release on the system CO-SIGNED BY Lead developer, tax portal Lead developer, permits Lead developer, payments Accessibility officer Head of Digital Services GRATWEG · FICTIONAL EXAMPLE · FIG. 1"
  },
