    "hash": "655098ec55c21d6d",
    "text": "Governance: the core team owns, contributors propose One page per change · nobody waits in silence Core team decides FAST LANE · AN ICON, A TOKEN VALUE, A FIX FULL RFC · A NEW COMPONENT OR A CHANGED BEHAVIOUR 12 contributors from the product teams One-page RFC problem, proposal, who it affects Core-team member decides within 2 days Open for comments every team can read and reply Core team decides within a 10-day decision window Built by the contributor a core-team reviewer pairs Declined the reason is written on the RFC Release notes with the contributor’s name Core team of 3 1 designer, 2 component developers small everything else accepted accepted declined GRATWEG · FICTIONAL EXAMPLE · FIG. 4"
  },
