    "hash": "909d2d03343ae987",
    "text": "What do we build on? Rated by the core team and the coalition · filled dots are better (for cost: cheaper) Custom component library Time to first benefit Accessibility Cost to run Brand fit Full control, and we maintain every line of it. Commercial kit Time to first benefit Accessibility Cost to run Brand fit Fast start, but a licence and a second visual language. CHOSEN Angular Material + our own tokens Time to first benefit Accessibility Cost to run Brand fit Teams already use it; accessibility comes built in. The compromises, signed once by brand: Material’s focus ring stays, dense tables keep their spacing, and the elevation shadows are toned down rather than removed. GRATWEG · FICTIONAL EXAMPLE · FIG. 3"
  },
