    "text": "The token pipeline: change once, ship everywhere Nobody edits a colour by hand · the brand team reviews tokens, not screens Figma variables Designers change a token, with its name and contrast note. DESIGN · BRAND CI ● Read-only key Reads the variables on every change; it can never write back. PIPELINE Style Dictionary color.primary color.primary-dark space.step Turns tokens into code for every platform we need. PIPELINE Angular Material theme @include mat.theme(…) The generated theme, with our tokens in place of Material’s. CORE TEAM Product packages Each product updates one package and gets every change. PRODUCT TEAMS GRATWEG · FICTIONAL EXAMPLE · FIG. 5"
